u or achievements in combat, everything is mine.<>You don't have to raise a finger, Commander. I'll settle everything for you."}, "65013": {"char_code": "HK416Mod_Live2D", "voice_key": "MOOD2", "caption": ""}, "65014": {"char_code": "HK416Mod_Live2D", "voice_key": "HELLO", "caption": "Please give me further instructions, Commander."}}}